{"a":[52,54],"h":"<p>Bu nükteye mebniy olmalıdır ki Hazreti Musâ cevabda Allah onlara da Peygamberler göderdi deyivermeyip de 52.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"57\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 56.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 33.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 33.7 40.6\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> şöyle dedi<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"219\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 218.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 33.0 39.7 46.6 46.6 66.7 78.0 78.0 93.7 105.0 105.0 105.0 111.7 129.0 138.0 138.0 144.7 144.7 162.7 169.6 177.7 177.7 186.7 186.7 193.6 193.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"39.7 111.7 129.0 169.6 202.6\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ya'ni onların hali bana gâibdir gaybe ılim de ancak rabbımın ındinde bir kitabdadir. Onların hali ne olduğunu ve ne olacağını ancak o, bilir her halde<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"196\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 195.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.7 39.7 39.7 46.6 62.3 74.3 91.6 102.7 102.7 102.7 109.6 126.7 126.7 126.7 137.3 137.3 151.6 167.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"27.7 46.6 66.7 74.3 109.6 151.6 171.7 179.3\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> rabbım şaşmaz ve unutmaz - o, yol göstermiş, onlar, kabul etmemişlerdir, zira 53.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"70\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 69.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 30.0 30.0 39.0 39.0 46.6\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"39.0 46.6 53.3\" y=\"20.3 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> o rabbımdır ki <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"194\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 194.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 23.2 23.2 32.2 32.2 40.4 75.0 75.0 83.2 87.7 95.2 111.0 111.0 120.0 120.0 132.0 148.4 159.0 165.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"40.4 56.2 56.2 83.2 132.0 148.4 159.0 165.7 177.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ilh... Bu görülen bir hidayettir.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"114\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 113.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 16.4 23.3 23.3 39.0 45.7 52.4 52.4 64.4 72.0 84.0 90.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"45.7 64.4 72.0 84.0 90.7 97.4\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> - burada gıyabdan tekellüme iltifat vardır<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"73\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 73.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 27.7 27.7 36.0 36.0 36.0 42.7 50.3\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"57.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> -<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 32.5 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 14.3 22.4\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> bâtıla ve fena şeylere uymaktan nehyeden akıl demektir.</p>"}